# Copy to tailscale.env (git ignores it) and fill in, or leave TS_AUTHKEY
# unset and sign in interactively: docker compose logs tailscale prints a
# login URL.
#
# The key must be created WITHOUT tags. A tagged node has no owning user,
# and moshpit setup refuses it (exit 17), because moshpit trusts exactly the
# Tailscale user who owns the node.
TS_AUTHKEY=tskey-auth-REPLACE-ME
